hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"27744","Haddathana Sufyan from Ibrahim ibn Maysara from Ibn Qarib from his father who said: I heard the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) say: O Allah, forgive those who shave; a man said: And those who shorten; he said on the fourth: And those who shorten; Sufyan shortening it with his hand; Sufyan said: And he said in that time as if he widened his hand."
